{"quest":{"line_id":"14010531","line_type":"5","order":545,"title":{"cn":"伤药紧缺","en":"Medicine Shortage","jp":"傷薬不足","kr":"부족한 포션"},"description":{"cn":"你们为因维护治安而受伤的卫兵炼制并分发了愈合伤药，缓解了他们的伤痛。","en":"You brew healing ointment and hand it out to injured guards, helping ease their pain.","jp":"あなたたちは、治安を守ろうとして負傷した衛兵に創傷治癒薬を調合して渡し、彼らの苦しみを和らげた。","kr":"치안을 지키다 다친 근위병들에게 상처 치료 포션을 나눠주며 고통을 덜어주었다."},"reputation_camp_id":"402","reputation_camp_title":{"cn":"萨罗克兰","en":"Sal'thorin","jp":"サロクディア","kr":"셀로클랜드"},"route":"#/season-4/daily/14010531","assets":[{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010531:1:1"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234010"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234020"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010531:1:2"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234030"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010531:1:3"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234040"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010531:1:4"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_14010531:1:4"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234050"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010531:1:5"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_14010531:1:5"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234060"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010531:1:6"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_14010531:1:6"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234070"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010531:1:7"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234080"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010531:1:8"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234090"}],"tasks":[{"task_id":"1","steps":[{"step_id":"1","pre_step_ids":[],"objective_title":{"cn":"与沙利叶对话","en":"Talk to Ravion","jp":"サリエと話す","kr":"사리에와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"与沙利叶对话，看看他是否需要帮助。","en":"Talk to Ravion and see if he needs any help.","jp":"サリエと話し、力になれることがあるか尋ねよう。","kr":"사리에와 대화해 도움이 필요한지 물어보자."}},{"step_id":"2","pre_step_ids":["1"],"objective_title":{"cn":"采集药材","en":"Gather Herbs","jp":"材料を集める","kr":"약재 채집하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"沙利叶希望你能为卫兵制作愈合伤药。采集制作伤药所需的药材。","en":"Ravion asks you to make healing ointment for t